      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PATH TO GREATNESS (3) was far from disgraced when last seen in the Inter Dominion series, recording a fourth and a fifth in the heats before a midfield effort in the consolation. Has had seven weeks off but draws well and has the class edge on these. DOUGS FLAME (8) has been hard to fault of late and made it two wins in a row when successful from this barrier at his latest appearance here, getting home by 2.2 metres. Drawn to enjoy an economical run so can be there at the finish again. ROCKNROLL WALLA (1) can give a sight again after leading from this draw and sticking on for second here last time. MY ULTIMATE FLYNN NZ (2) draws well and is worth including after turning in a good effort last start to come from wide and place.",
